      "limitation": "Single-chain simplification of hM1Dq + Gpaα",
      "description": "Does not include Gβγ and may overestimate the conformational stability of Gα"
    },
    {
      "limitation": "Membrane lipid approximation",
      "description": "Approximation of the BY4741 plasma membrane composition; real yeast membranes exhibit microdomain heterogeneity"
    },
    {
      "limitation": "Scoring function limitations",
      "description": "ClusPro/HADDOCK scoring functions are not absolute binding free energies and cannot be directly compared across different targets"
    },
    {
      "limitation": "Implicit solvent/membrane environment ignored",
      "description": "Docking was performed in vacuum/implicit solvent, without considering the membrane, water, ions, or glycosylation"
    },
    {
      "limitation": "Insufficient sampling",
      "description": "100 ns may be insufficient to capture slow conformational changes; MM-GBSA SEM 1.27-3.46 kcal/mol"
    }
